  <p>
  <center>
 
  </center>
  <strong><font size="4" color="#FF0000">JOIN PWO</font></strong></p>
  <p align="left">

<font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">This is a Philatelic <i>Webmasters</i> Organization. Please enter information referring to sites names and
URLs and </font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#FF0000">not</font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">
to individual pages (even if the pages treat different subjects)!!! Your name should
appear several times on the list </font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#FF0000">only</font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">
if you, as Webmaster, have created and/or maintain several </font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#FF0000">different</font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">
philatelic </font>
<font face="Arial" size="3" color="#FF0000">
 sites</font><font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">.</font>
  </p>

  <p align="left">

<font face="Arial" size="3" color="#800000">Please note that your e-mail address
will appear <span style="background-color: #FFFF00">only</span> in the Members
Area and will be thus accessible only to PWO members.</font>
  </p>

<p align="left"><font face="Arial" color="#800000" size="2">Please use this form to join the
Philatelic Webmasters Organization. Please read the <a href="../statutes.htm"><i>Statutes</i></a>
before applying for PWO membership.&nbsp;</font></p>

<p align="left"><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">Important Tips</font></p>

<ul>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2"><i>Site Name</i>: please fill
    it in, using the right capitalization, like &quot;Paintings on Stamps&quot;
    and not like &quot;paintings on Stamps&quot;. Give suggestive names, that
    say something about your site (</font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">not</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    like: John's Stamp Page)</font></li>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2"><i>Site Type</i>:
    Please click <a href="../cgi-bin/categories.htm" target="_blank"><i>here</i></a> for
    more information on different site types.</font></li>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><i><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">Author's Name (</font></i><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">max</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">.
    25 characters ): please fill in your
    LAST name in CAPS and then your first name, using the right capitalization
    and a <i>comma</i>, like &quot;MANTA</font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2"><b>,</b> </font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    Victor&quot;, </font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">not</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    like
    &quot;victor manta&quot;, </font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">not</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    like VICTOR MANTA and </font><font color="#FF0000" face="Arial" size="2">not</font><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">
    like &quot;MANTA Victor&quot;.</font></li>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2"><i>Languages</i>: If possible
    choose a
    language that many people speak on the Internet, like English.&nbsp;</font></li>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">If you have made a <i>mistake</i>,
    send us an <a href="mailto:president@pwmo.org"><i>e-mail</i></a> and we'll
    correct the wrong data. Don't enter your data again, please.</font></li>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">Please <span style="background-color: #FFFF00">click
    only ones</span> the &quot;Join PWO&quot; button. Thank you a lot!</font></li>
  <li>
    <p align="left"><font color="#800000" face="Arial" size="2">After having successfully
    joined PWO, please send us an <a href="mailto:president@pwmo.org"><i>e-mail</i></a>
    and <span style="background-color: #FFFF00">ask</span> for the <span style="background-color: #FFFF00">User
    Name and Password,</span> in order to access the area reserved to PWO
    members. Please put into the Subject line of your e-mail: &quot;PWO Members
    Area Password&quot; and write in the body of the e-mail your name and the
    name of the country where you are living. TIA.</font></li>
</ul>

  <p align="center"><strong><font size="4" color="#FF0000">
